# Boot -> title -> map zoom-out loading -> free roam, on the save copy.
# Segments (marks): title, map_zoom (the zoom-out loading, from the accepted
# Start until the player is in the city), free_roam (10 s at the spawn point).
wait 8s
mark title
# Start is ignored during the title screen's camera cuts: press until it takes.
press_until start left_title every=2s timeout=90s
mark map_zoom
wait_until roam 180s
mark free_roam
wait 10s
mark end
